"""pose-oracle CLI: independent pivot and pose fixtures.

  ./oracle inspect   --rig R.glb --map M.json --contract C.json --out rig.json
  ./oracle sweep     --reference rig.json --map M.json --contract C.json --out-dir D [--profile full|quick]
  ./oracle cameras   --out cameras.json --map M.json --seed TEXT
  ./oracle synth     --contract C.json --out-dir controls
  ./oracle historical --poses-dir D --failure-index FAILURE_INDEX.json --rig-info rig.json --map M.json --contract C.json
  ./oracle extract   --take-dir T --rig R.glb --map M.json --frames FRAME[,FRAME] --out-dir D
  ./oracle measure   --rig R.glb --map M.json --contract C.json --cameras K.json --poses S.json --out report.json
  ./oracle compare   --candidate C.glb --candidate-map M1.json --incumbent I.glb --incumbent-map M0.json
                     --contract C.json --cameras K.json --poses S.json --out compare.json

Exit codes: 0 accepted, 1 rejected (the measured asset failed a registered
class), 2 refusal or harness error with JSON {reason, retry_when, next_command}.
Every command that starts Blender does so inside the admitted 8G scope.
"""
